---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Investing Dojo — Case Study" description="AI-powered investment education with a belt-graded curriculum">
  <section class="hero-case">
    <a href="/work" class="back-link">← Work</a>
    <div class="case-tenets">
      <span class="tenet">AI</span>
      <span class="tenet">Clarity</span>
      <span class="tenet">Growth</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Investing Dojo</h1>
    <p class="case-tagline">Master the markets — from White Belt to Black Belt</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Problem</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <p>
        Financial education is broken. It's either too complex (written by experts for experts) 
        or too simplistic (get-rich-quick nonsense). There's no middle ground that respects 
        intelligence while meeting people where they are.
      </p>
      <p>
        Podcasts are exploding with investment wisdom, but who has time to listen to hours 
        of content? The insights exist — they're just trapped in audio format.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Approach</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <h3>1. Belt-Graded Curriculum</h3>
      <p>Borrowed from martial arts — start at White Belt, progress through Yellow, Orange, Green, Blue, Brown, to Black Belt mastery. Each belt unlocks more advanced concepts. Clear progression, no overwhelm.</p>
      
      <h3>2. AI-Powered Content Pipeline</h3>
      <p>Financial podcasts get automatically transcribed, summarised, and transformed into readable articles. Key insights extracted, jargon decoded, actionable takeaways highlighted.</p>
      
      <h3>3. Gamification Without Gimmicks</h3>
      <p>The belt system isn't just decoration — it's a genuine learning pathway. Users can track their progress and see what's ahead without feeling lost in an ocean of content.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Build</h2>
    <div class="case-content">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Automated ingestion</strong> — Podcasts transcribed and processed daily</li>
        <li><strong>AI summarisation</strong> — Long episodes → digestible 5-min reads</li>
        <li><strong>Belt taxonomy</strong> — Content tagged by difficulty level</li>
        <li><strong>Progressive disclosure</strong> — Start simple, go deep when ready</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">The Outcome</h2>
    <div class="case-outcome">
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">401</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">articles published</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">8</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">belt levels</span>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stat">
        <span class="outcome-number">Live</span>
        <span class="outcome-label">in production</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="outcome-text">A complete investment education platform that meets learners where they are and takes them as far as they want to go.</p>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Visit</h2>
    <div class="demo-box">
      <a href="https://investingdojo.co/" target="_blank" class="cta-button">investingdojo.co ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section related-section">
    <h2 class="section-label">Related Content</h2>
    <div class="related-items">
      <a href="/insights" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">🎙️</span>
        <div>
          <strong>10x your AI results with context engineering</strong>
          <span>The technique behind the content pipeline</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/ai" class="related-link">
        <span class="related-icon">→</span>
        <div>
          <strong>AI Tenet</strong>
          <span>More about how I build with AI</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="section cta-section">
    <h2>Got content chaos that needs taming?</h2>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com" class="cta-button">Let's Talk</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero-case {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  
  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  
  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  .hero-case h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  
  .case-content {
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  
  .case-content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .case-content ul {
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .case-content li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  .case-content strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .case-outcome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .outcome-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .outcome-number {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .outcome-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  
  .outcome-text {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  
  .demo-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .related-section {
    border-top: none;
  }
  
  .related-items {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  
  .related-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  
  .related-link:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
  }
  
  .related-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .related-link strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  
  .related-link span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
  }
  
  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
</style>
